# tools/conformance/css_variables_suite.py: the vectors of web-platform-tests' css-variables and css-properties-values-api that fail and whose
# expectation does not bind this library, one line a case. Columns (tab separated): vector (file#n), what it asks, stage (register,
# invalid-accepted, style, cycle, limit), the answer the library gives, class, and the reason, which quotes the sentence of the served draft (or of
# the suite's own page) that decides it. A case that passes, that is not here, whose answer is not the one listed, or whose reason quotes nothing
# fails the gate. Classes:
#   draft-newer        the served draft says what the page says and the pinned data predates it
#   wpt-tentative      the page is a tentative test: no specification decides it yet
#   needs-environment  the answer depends on the document, the layout or the user agent, which a parser does not have
#   wpt-wrong          the page contradicts the served draft
